Extra tools from 0002-extra-tools-multiaccount.patch, rebuilt for upstream
chigwell/telegram-mcp at commit 596087228b8946c4d5b51d2c3abde4bb676bc64a.

Covers telegram_mcp/tools/chats.py and telegram_mcp/tools/messages.py only:
search_dialogs, search_messages_global, find_media, get_new_messages_since,
resolve_message_link, get_unread_mentions. The added code is unchanged; only its
place in messages.py moved (upstream grew transcribe_voice after list_messages).
The events.py and groups.py parts of the original patch are not carried over.

